                                                "text": "Womanhood was achieved at twenty-one, when the female was \"adulted\"; manhood was fully achieved at twenty-five, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5c98c5c-92ae-4101-ad93-636eee547652",
                                                "sense_id": "e2af9784-df38-3af5-a507-2446ffa8299a",
                                                "text": "The process of adulting children[…] overlaps with the process of the uncontrolled infiltration of the media[…] into children’s imagination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
